# Normalize line endings.
#
# `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows checks files out with CRLF, but Prettier is
# configured with `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this file the two disagree and
# `npm run format:check` fails on a fresh clone — a latent issue that surfaced
# in Phase 1. Forcing LF in the working tree makes the gate deterministic on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
